        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "三比二领先，比分还紧紧缠在一起。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "62b214727ba313d80916d38e8f1ffae729b4204be0f9c9926a5d2feeb8735553",
      "words_sha256": "111af75fb0e7b5949bba9817c94f134478a79065d43e55697dc2538ca1c9aac2"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:0c47bb6b32e5eea0894354e11071ca449458fa80cfeb58d0d718adc7da5e62e1",
      "request_id": "0c47bb6b32e5eea0894354e11071ca449458fa80cfeb58d0d718adc7da5e62e1",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "152f3cc4c7103777e720fe0fc50f47c1",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "四比三，他还领先着。可打到五比五，莱赫奇卡开始逼近。瓦林卡的发球局被拖进苦战，盘末的压力落到了自己身上。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "fba3cc34cd7443c44415c3a4e19ec36a98a3717594c7be5e2af9f98543e746da",
      "words_sha256": "d156a1299423e667c7847324baa178e63d9c16a5ccf13a668947a4b14010cea4"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:173d73f99aed223d6ca8ef1e892e39b7e5692528439675fcdadb3a308a1c9237",
      "request_id": "173d73f99aed223d6ca8ef1e892e39b7e5692528439675fcdadb3a308a1c9237",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "55c9d7f79063e08ee894fa1676c19ded",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七来到二比三。他还有追赶的空间，可莱赫奇卡把球调开，又把优势带向了赛点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "23cdcef62e2bb6b81857e0e3f1fd7262e159bf477809a05ee9185026b011bfd6",
      "words_sha256": "a4405f39adbacd68b51cddc880a496fb9fcf9f64a4ab98c79a2cf538264cbc5a"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:2106c9571a461242da890c51bb6ac6787ad40d9958c06a2b1a7a0cde4ecf1099",
      "request_id": "2106c9571a461242da890c51bb6ac6787ad40d9958c06a2b1a7a0cde4ecf1099",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "caf3aee8f8290257bbba227fc85e2a3b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五比五，又到了盘末。瓦林卡继续向前压，试着把机会留在自己这一边。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "e7eb84876650946a2fdc26010d9a4f112d610bfcd332034a3b151cc1f595f6a3",
      "words_sha256": "7c6b18f0cdef619b4bfe458a94cb3c14382507a13b55fac21846d897ea59b82e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:3b108a2b0febf8fdaaff12570f27731da5cee606dd84fc6dbe21392780ee55b5",
      "request_id": "3b108a2b0febf8fdaaff12570f27731da5cee606dd84fc6dbe21392780ee55b5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "282e0104136a6aafc2f6a8a2d3660218",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "制胜分十四比二十六，非受迫性失误三十比二十五。火力和稳定，莱赫奇卡占了上风。瓦林卡还是把第二盘拖进了抢七。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "70ac9a4d5c523611e6e56d0a4928241bf7ac5b9809969da83cbd30d4f59d8ed3",
      "words_sha256": "7a84e5396be53967a5f3149d8419b9646f01bc7a78e1332413dc730523fb67cd"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4f303684c995c14ef90e5f6f7ff4d6434da7f7b042c76e248aa86b1e326fd500",
      "request_id": "4f303684c995c14ef90e5f6f7ff4d6434da7f7b042c76e248aa86b1e326fd500",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "a69a297f9f7ea439d9f3b411ab76d0a3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘，他重新守住发球局，一局一局跟着走。那些熟悉的反拍、上网和奔跑还在。每一次赢分，主场的声音就再响一点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c380883b8b9b474c12569e03e542a4495aef634fdda60d43b2ec5a8b85d01a12",
      "words_sha256": "70d3efce36944424aff6f9567d4699c62fa634e1f78475d205aa31a7926cbf02"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4f4caa189e4195d7287eec68652a769783ccfa958ecd9326ccd717a64f3f2d9e",
      "request_id": "4f4caa189e4195d7287eec68652a769783ccfa958ecd9326ccd717a64f3f2d9e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9681d643f66fa2ad6b9aa46e86eac57e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "六比五，只要再赢一局，就能把比赛带进决胜盘。瓦林卡还在寻找机会，莱赫奇卡也没有放松。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "ff5f7c2aeba50ba9d5607c7d73455838b1a79bf68e2c45bdd8dc64efc91cf70a",
      "words_sha256": "8e2dd1e801ebd528abcaaca4274c04c510f81bd39cc9d5ad207594f43db3c460"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:6d0360e41e8aab76d948c7c4fe452b4df43b4e2917c48c42ed0e316db2539e6e",
      "request_id": "6d0360e41e8aab76d948c7c4fe452b4df43b4e2917c48c42ed0e316db2539e6e",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7cd8a1346a68641d512da9e9a3519395",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五比七，先丢一盘。对四十一岁的瓦林卡来说，再丢一盘，职业巡回赛就到这里了。可他没有让这场告别很快结束。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3f2b4787dab5fac74b2935e23e3bd5f589f72ab7a8b08c9580a2f38aa7818be1",
      "words_sha256": "b5d7fc1d29edb29969875efca94e647aa53f43fc304f37e0a148b94577c8334e"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:725ea654e148690791a23f2c1313d73c1abd54fd7e305ec0741c74b6916d57d3",
      "request_id": "725ea654e148690791a23f2c1313d73c1abd54fd7e305ec0741c74b6916d57d3",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "45c6fd8ae080d067a5cda6975ab461d7",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "北京时间十月二十八号凌晨，巴塞尔首轮。告别仪式后，瓦林卡回到中央球场，打职业巡回赛最后一战。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "708685966c7dd8414b8a539a2a2184dc236f1942c20d16cfb2bea58ea6814fef",
      "words_sha256": "ceb9e866f7c3c868aab13fbdde0cc4cd4aac9cf7eee7219aa1d31379a7f6dbf7"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:af671a02d0d099224599d677fc56d691fd4476d1b24e7e9875741ae3ebc93299",
      "request_id": "af671a02d0d099224599d677fc56d691fd4476d1b24e7e9875741ae3ebc93299",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d6986b1ac200ee4c89cfe9b2f8d2001a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "想把比赛带下去，每一次向前压，都要自己争。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "672ef9edb7e06842bea9cb16a248affa08e5115b765d661133119af69cf42e03",
      "words_sha256": "ffaf89ecff1c6e3601eedb5d05bdd9ced10bad543d4987c83949c9152b3f23ec"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request_id": "b80ad40cf03e2a1bf0849f74b5dd89f9591e3dfac6354816bf5cd093c739d31d",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "20da8f5468902afbbecb78daefb15d83",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "关注网球时插，时插归我，好球归你。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "3d7277d26afc569ab1979d3485891d79e290c7f020c7ffccb0a9e1a2d11c811f",
      "words_sha256": "ffd92401e4e51d044cd0ba811dd56c27dfa59f0de4734ee872348e09ba3401b8"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:b825cb50d4a97aae1ac1fd16920becae03b9eac598805e83398433c47e386ba0",
      "request_id": "b825cb50d4a97aae1ac1fd16920becae03b9eac598805e83398433c47e386ba0",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4b0ac5cb3c20c0d0db5c3003bc1481f4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "莱赫奇卡守住发球局，六比六，第二盘进入抢七。最后一段路，瓦林卡又要一分一分地争。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "433bffe98bed8d3912073d192512eb66857354b9417ce00cde9cbe9ab0c5c5cf",
      "words_sha256": "f24bf76de49f37f9f1159dad3087d81f5f4745c9ebb9344c7dbc5918fb1ff759"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:bf1b5930b9590394828415b167ac1012afdc4ef8a4405632e5ea546243ef696b",
      "request_id": "bf1b5930b9590394828415b167ac1012afdc4ef8a4405632e5ea546243ef696b",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c11fe9d86e011684af8a62ac5bbc64f3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一比一，再到二比二。比分没有拉开，瓦林卡继续跟住。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "63c62078c1204e5e078443c8665cd787833d72038374610d63c124a0dc67281e",
      "words_sha256": "f77dbfddf40c1b2487de4da3646591a258411f5a358fe9d68e495a78fcdd6a8c"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:dfac058bd171b8671321f63c0c3d698a11fea7b98e16fd6751486eb64b426bd5",
      "request_id": "dfac058bd171b8671321f63c0c3d698a11fea7b98e16fd6751486eb64b426bd5",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f1cd6f2ea57f312e7651311fd87b19de",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后一战结束了。熟悉的单手反拍，和那些永不言弃的回合，都留在了球迷心里。你最难忘瓦林卡的哪一场比赛？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "d015bcb0ba1d85950a414301b63214f49729863d694a5004bbac2bcce30bc93c",
      "words_sha256": "dfa5713d7141d854443a79fbfbd52fb247ea4da74eac1832a4e87b0f7208807d"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:e510c2ff753dcec8ced3fd3119ef496b7cf6996b46f2d854c1ebef1869275eb8",
      "request_id": "e510c2ff753dcec8ced3fd3119ef496b7cf6996b46f2d854c1ebef1869275eb8",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7cfabc09417cbbcb740fa71742e7a654",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一局守住了，四比三。瓦林卡用奔跑和对抗，把比赛重新撑到了盘末。告别就在眼前，他仍然没有停下。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "91a6722a0b60531bea1d61a1248cc3d4c8fc065a4f61b78d707dbf3e39f48a2c",
      "words_sha256": "ef0f4cdf2b96232460ca2638490761a5346dc98e741da6297c1a5d3b14189fba"
    },
    {
