        "text": "第二盘，他重新守住发球局，一局一局跟着走。那些熟悉的反拍、上网和奔跑还在。每一次赢分，主场的声音就再响一点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "63c62078c1204e5e078443c8665cd787833d72038374610d63c124a0dc67281e",
      "words_sha256": "f77dbfddf40c1b2487de4da3646591a258411f5a358fe9d68e495a78fcdd6a8c",
      "words_path": "voice_09.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "c11fe9d86e011684af8a62ac5bbc64f3",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "一比一，再到二比二。比分没有拉开，瓦林卡继续跟住。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "672ef9edb7e06842bea9cb16a248affa08e5115b765d661133119af69cf42e03",
      "words_sha256": "ffaf89ecff1c6e3601eedb5d05bdd9ced10bad543d4987c83949c9152b3f23ec",
      "words_path": "voice_10.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "d6986b1ac200ee4c89cfe9b2f8d2001a",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "想把比赛带下去，每一次向前压，都要自己争。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "91a6722a0b60531bea1d61a1248cc3d4c8fc065a4f61b78d707dbf3e39f48a2c",
      "words_sha256": "ef0f4cdf2b96232460ca2638490761a5346dc98e741da6297c1a5d3b14189fba",
      "words_path": "voice_13.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7cfabc09417cbbcb740fa71742e7a654",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "这一局守住了，四比三。瓦林卡用奔跑和对抗，把比赛重新撑到了盘末。告别就在眼前，他仍然没有停下。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "e7eb84876650946a2fdc26010d9a4f112d610bfcd332034a3b151cc1f595f6a3",
      "words_sha256": "7c6b18f0cdef619b4bfe458a94cb3c14382507a13b55fac21846d897ea59b82e",
      "words_path": "voice_14.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "caf3aee8f8290257bbba227fc85e2a3b",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "五比五，又到了盘末。瓦林卡继续向前压，试着把机会留在自己这一边。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "ff5f7c2aeba50ba9d5607c7d73455838b1a79bf68e2c45bdd8dc64efc91cf70a",
      "words_sha256": "8e2dd1e801ebd528abcaaca4274c04c510f81bd39cc9d5ad207594f43db3c460",
      "words_path": "voice_15.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "9681d643f66fa2ad6b9aa46e86eac57e",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "六比五，只要再赢一局，就能把比赛带进决胜盘。瓦林卡还在寻找机会，莱赫奇卡也没有放松。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "433bffe98bed8d3912073d192512eb66857354b9417ce00cde9cbe9ab0c5c5cf",
      "words_sha256": "f24bf76de49f37f9f1159dad3087d81f5f4745c9ebb9344c7dbc5918fb1ff759",
      "words_path": "voice_17.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "4b0ac5cb3c20c0d0db5c3003bc1481f4",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "莱赫奇卡守住发球局，六比六，第二盘进入抢七。最后一段路，瓦林卡又要一分一分地争。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "23cdcef62e2bb6b81857e0e3f1fd7262e159bf477809a05ee9185026b011bfd6",
      "words_sha256": "a4405f39adbacd68b51cddc880a496fb9fcf9f64a4ab98c79a2cf538264cbc5a",
      "words_path": "voice_18.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "55c9d7f79063e08ee894fa1676c19ded",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "抢七来到二比三。他还有追赶的空间，可莱赫奇卡把球调开，又把优势带向了赛点。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "70ac9a4d5c523611e6e56d0a4928241bf7ac5b9809969da83cbd30d4f59d8ed3",
      "words_sha256": "7a84e5396be53967a5f3149d8419b9646f01bc7a78e1332413dc730523fb67cd",
      "words_path": "voice_20.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "282e0104136a6aafc2f6a8a2d3660218",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "制胜分十四比二十六，非受迫性失误三十比二十五。火力和稳定，莱赫奇卡占了上风。瓦林卡还是把第二盘拖进了抢七。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22.mp3",
      "audio_sha256": "d015bcb0ba1d85950a414301b63214f49729863d694a5004bbac2bcce30bc93c",
      "words_sha256": "dfa5713d7141d854443a79fbfbd52fb247ea4da74eac1832a4e87b0f7208807d",
      "words_path": "voice_22.words.json",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "f1cd6f2ea57f312e7651311fd87b19de",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "最后一战结束了。熟悉的单手反拍，和那些永不言弃的回合，都留在了球迷心里。你最难忘瓦林卡的哪一场比赛？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      }
    },
